WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:18,460
I am Song Yu, the one who can only be desired

2
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:23,670
Maybe at first, I was just curious and couldn't help but pay attention.

3
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:29,040
But this curiosity, I don’t know when, changed its taste.

4
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:33,160
When I came back to my senses, I could no longer avoid it.

5
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:36,720
I want to see him and hear him speak

6
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,980
I never know what love is

7
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:43,200
Now I understand that I am willing to work hard for someone

8
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,380
It tastes like this

9
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,780
Ayu, you provoked me

10
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:51,040
I will never escape again in this life
